"<h2>✉️ رسالة من {0}</h2>\n  <div class=\"letter\"><p>يا {1}،</p>\n  <p>عشت في وادي الصدى {2} يوماً. كسبت {3} ذهب، ونزلت إلى الطابق {4} في الزنزانة والطابق {5} في المنجم.</p>\n  {6}\n  <p>{7}أهل القرية يذكرونني بخير، و{8} بالذات كان أقرب الناس لي. {9} معهم من الصفر.</p>\n  {10}\n  <p>المزرعة الآن لك. {11} قصتك.</p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:left\">— {12}، الجيل {13}</p></div>\n  <p>{14} <b>+{15}</b> نجمة إرث — صرفها في {16} شجرة الإرث.</p>\n  {17}\n  <button class=\"btn gold\" data-a=\"closeModal\" style=\"width:100%\">🌱 ابدأ الجيل {18}</button>": "<h2>✉️ A letter from {0}</h2>\n  <div class=\"letter\"><p>Dear {1},</p>\n  <p>I lived in Echo Valley for {2} days. I earned {3} gold, and reached floor {4} of the dungeon and floor {5} of the mine.</p>\n  {6}\n  <p>{7}The villagers remember me fondly, and {8} was the closest of all to me. {9} from zero with them.</p>\n  {10}\n  <p>The farm is yours now. {11} your own story.</p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:left\">— {12}, generation {13}</p></div>\n  <p>{14} <b>+{15}</b> legacy stars — spend them in the {16} legacy tree.</p>\n  {17}\n  <button class=\"btn gold\" data-a=\"closeModal\" style=\"width:100%\">🌱 Start generation {18}</button>",
