"<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🔨 ورشة الحداد قاسم</h2><span class=\"stat\">خصم الصداقة {0}%</span></div>\n  <p class=\"hint\">كل تطوير يحتاج ذهباً ومعدناً من المنجم. المعادن مقفلة 🔒 في السوق افتراضياً حتى لا تبيعها بالخطأ.</p><div class=\"smith-scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\">{1}{2}{3}</div>": "<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🔨 Jack's smithy</h2><span class=\"stat\">Friendship discount {0}%</span></div>\n  <p class=\"hint\">Every upgrade needs gold and ore from the mine. Ores are locked 🔒 in the market by default so you don't sell them by mistake.</p><div class=\"smith-scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\">{1}{2}{3}</div>",
