"<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🎣 البحيرة</h2></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">🔒 خلف التلال بحيرة صافية ما اقترب منها أحد من زمن جدك... تنفتح في <b>الجيل الثاني</b>. تقاعد من صفحة 🌳 الإرث لتفتحها.</p></div>": "<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🎣 Lake</h2></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">🔒 Beyond the hills lies a clear lake nobody has visited since your grandfather's time... it opens in <b>Second generation</b>. Retire from the 🌳 Legacy page to unlock it.</p></div>",
"<button class=\"btn ghost sm\" disabled>🔒 {0} (صيد {1})</button>": "<button class=\"btn ghost sm\" disabled>🔒 {0} (fishing {1})</button>",
"{0} وظّف صياد ({1}💰)": "{0} Hire a fisher ({1}💰)",
"⛵ القارب (مستوى {0}): الصيادين أرخص {1}%": "⛵ Boat (level {0}): fishers {1}% cheaper",
"طُعم تلقائي": "Auto bait",
"الطُّعم التلقائي يستخدم المحصول اللي عندك منه أكثر. اقفل 🔒 المحصول في السوق عشان ما ينباع، وخصص له حقول عشان ما يخلص.": "Auto bait uses the crop you have the most of. Lock 🔒 the crop in the market so it isn't sold, and assign fields to it so it never runs out.",
"<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🎣 {0} {1}</h2>{2}</div>\n  <p class=\"hint\">ارمِ السنارة لتصطاد، أو وظّف صيادين يصطادون عنك. كل صيدة لها ندرة ووزن: النادرة والأسطورية تعطيك أكثر من سمكة، وكل ما كانت أثقل كانت أغلى. مستوى الصيد يفتح أسماكاً وأماكن جديدة، والسنارة (عند الحداد) تزيد القوة وفرصة النادر. وأحياناً يطلع صندوق كنز 🧰!</p>\n  <div class=\"spots\">{3}</div>\n  <div class=\"minebox\"><button class=\"digbtn lakebtn\" data-a=\"cast\"><span class=\"bobber-scene\">{4}</span>اصطد!<small class=\"hold-hint\">اضغط مطوّل ✊</small></button>\n  <div class=\"mineinfo\">\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>العضّة</span><span id=\"lk_t\"></span></div><div class=\"bar\"><i id=\"lk_p\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>آخر صيدة</span><span id=\"lk_last\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>قوة الرمية</span><span id=\"lk_pow\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>{5} الصيادون: {6}</span><span id=\"lk_rate\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\">{7}{8}</div>{9}\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>فرصة النادرة / الأسطورية</span><span id=\"lk_ch\"></span></div>\n  </div></div>\n  <div class=\"baitbox\"><div class=\"kv\"><span>🪱 الطُّعم: <b id=\"lk_bait\"></b> صيدة</span><span class=\"hint\">يضاعف فرصة النادرة والأسطورية</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\">{10}\n    <button class=\"btn {11} sm\" data-a=\"autoBait\">{12} {13}</button></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">{14}</p></div>\n  </div>": "<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🎣 {0} {1}</h2>{2}</div>\n  <p class=\"hint\">Cast your line to fish, or hire fishers to fish for you. Every catch has a rarity and a weight: rare and legendary catches give you more than one fish, and the heavier it is, the more it's worth. Your fishing level opens new fish and new spots, and the rod (at the smith) raises your power and rare chance. Sometimes a treasure chest 🧰 comes up!</p>\n  <div class=\"spots\">{3}</div>\n  <div class=\"minebox\"><button class=\"digbtn lakebtn\" data-a=\"cast\"><span class=\"bobber-scene\">{4}</span>Cast!<small class=\"hold-hint\">Hold ✊</small></button>\n  <div class=\"mineinfo\">\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>Bite</span><span id=\"lk_t\"></span></div><div class=\"bar\"><i id=\"lk_p\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>Last catch</span><span id=\"lk_last\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>Cast power</span><span id=\"lk_pow\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>{5} Fishers: {6}</span><span id=\"lk_rate\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\">{7}{8}</div>{9}\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>Rare / legendary chance</span><span id=\"lk_ch\"></span></div>\n  </div></div>\n  <div class=\"baitbox\"><div class=\"kv\"><span>🪱 Bait: <b id=\"lk_bait\"></b> catches</span><span class=\"hint\">Doubles the rare and legendary chance</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\">{10}\n    <button class=\"btn {11} sm\" data-a=\"autoBait\">{12} {13}</button></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">{14}</p></div>\n  </div>",
"<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>📖 ألبوم الأسماك</h2><span class=\"stat\">{0}/{1} • +{2}% سعر السمك</span></div>\n  <p class=\"hint\">ألبوم العائلة ما يضيع مع الأجيال. اصطد كل سمكة بندراتها الثلاث (عادية ونادرة وأسطورية) وتاخذ +4% سعر السمك للأبد، وكل ملك تصطاده يعطيك +10%.</p><div class=\"ores album\">": "<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>📖 Fish album</h2><span class=\"stat\">{0}/{1} • +{2}% fish price</span></div>\n  <p class=\"hint\">The family album is never lost between generations. Catch every fish in all three rarities (common, rare and legendary) for +4% fish price forever, and every king you catch gives +10%.</p><div class=\"ores album\">",
