"<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🎛️ الخدمات</h2><span class=\"stat\">💰 {0} بالثانية</span></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">الخدمات العامة تخدم القرية وتجيب ذهب لحالها كل ثانية، بدون سوق. تبقى معك حتى لو جدّدت المصنع، ودخلها يكبر مع مضاعف الذهب في القرية.</p><div class=\"grid ind-grid\">": "<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>🎛️ Services</h2><span class=\"stat\">💰 {0} per second</span></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">Public services serve the village and bring in gold every second by themselves, with no market. They stay with you even if you renew the factory, and their income grows with the village gold multiplier.</p><div class=\"grid ind-grid\">",
