"<div class=\"panel ind-tease open\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>⚙️ عصر الصناعة</h2></div><p class=\"hint\">عصر الصناعة مفتوح لعائلتك. القرية والمصنع يشتغلون مع بعض.</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn gold\" data-a=\"world\" data-v=\"ind\">⚙️ روح للمصنع</button></div></div>": "<div class=\"panel ind-tease open\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>⚙️ Industrial Age</h2></div><p class=\"hint\">The Industrial Age is open to your family. The village and the factory work together.</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn gold\" data-a=\"world\" data-v=\"ind\">⚙️ Go to the factory</button></div></div>",
"⚙️ افتح عصر الصناعة ({0} نجمة)": "⚙️ Open the Industrial Age ({0} stars)",
"<div class=\"panel ind-tease\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>⚙️ عصر الصناعة</h2><span class=\"stat\">🔒</span></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">بعيد عن الوادي فيه أرض فاضية تنتظر عائلة تبني فيها أول مصنع. عالم جديد تبنيه من الصفر، والقرية تكمل شغلها وأنت هناك، والمصنع يرخّص عمال المنجم والصيادين لين توصل 200 عامل.</p>\n    <ul class=\"ind-conds\">{0}{1}{2}</ul>\n    <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn gold\" data-a=\"indUnlock\" {3}>{4}</button></div></div>": "<div class=\"panel ind-tease\"><div class=\"ph\"><h2>⚙️ Industrial Age</h2><span class=\"stat\">🔒</span></div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">Far from the valley lies empty land waiting for a family to build its first factory. A new world you build from nothing; the village keeps working while you're there, and the factory makes miners and fishers cheaper until you reach 200 workers.</p>\n    <ul class=\"ind-conds\">{0}{1}{2}</ul>\n    <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn gold\" data-a=\"indUnlock\" {3}>{4}</button></div></div>",
"<div class=\"seed-heading\"><h3>اختر البذرة</h3><small>محاصيل لكل موسم</small></div><div class=\"season-picker\" aria-label=\"موسم البذور\">{0}</div>": "<div class=\"seed-heading\"><h3>Pick a seed</h3><small>Crops for each season</small></div><div class=\"season-picker\" aria-label=\"Seed season\">{0}</div>",
"<p class=\"hint\">أنت خارج الزنزانة. صحتك تتعافى ببطء.</p>": "<p class=\"hint\">You're outside the dungeon. Your HP recovers slowly.</p>",
