"<small class=\"hint\">ما أحد للحين، كن الأول!</small>": "<small class=\"hint\">Nobody yet, be the first!</small>",
"<div class=\"wk-box wk-mod\"><b>🛠️ وضع المطوّر: المحظورين ({0})</b><small class=\"hint\">اضغط 🚫 جنب أي اسم في القوائم تحت عشان تحظره. المحظور يختفي من المتصدرين، وأرقامه ما تنقبل.</small>": "<div class=\"wk-box wk-mod\"><b>🛠️ Developer mode: banned players ({0})</b><small class=\"hint\">Press 🚫 next to any name in the lists below to ban it. A banned player disappears from the leaderboard, and their numbers are refused.</small>",
"↩️ رجّعه": "↩️ Let back",
"↩️ رجع للمتصدرين": "↩️ Back on the leaderboard",
"🚫 انحظر": "🚫 Banned",
"❌ ما انحفظ، تأكد إن قواعد Firebase منشورة": "❌ Not saved. Make sure the Firebase rules are published",
